{"id":"658960","name":"家常炒茄子","author":"美食家1924G","authorId":"12592714","desc":"","cover":"images/658960/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉沫","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子洗净，开对半。","img":"images/658960/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剞三刀断一刀，或者一刀一断，会更入味。","img":"images/658960/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盐水泡十几分钟茄子不会发黑变色。","img":"images/658960/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"挤掉水分，拍上干淀粉。","img":"images/658960/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水烧开后，将裹好粉的茄子蒸5分钟。","img":"images/658960/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"五花肉或者瘦肉切沫。","img":"images/658960/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"青红椒切碎（喜欢吃蒜的，可以一起切蒜沫）。","img":"images/658960/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切葱花。","img":"images/658960/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调酱汁：盐，味精，糖，生抽，蚝油，淀粉，水。","img":"images/658960/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/658960/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下肉沫，炒至泛白，然后下青红椒（有蒜沫，一起下），炒匀。","img":"images/658960/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入料酒。","img":"images/658960/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"调入酱汁，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/658960/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入茄子，炒匀。","img":"images/658960/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入葱花。","img":"images/658960/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"加点陈醋炒匀，吃起来更香，不会油腻。","img":"images/658960/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"起锅前，再加入葱油，炒匀。","img":"images/658960/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"完成✅","img":"images/658960/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}